  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 3003.09 Registrations Subject to Suspension or Revocation. In the event a person's registration privileges are suspended or revoked pursuant to RSA 261:180, III, all registrations on which the person's name appears shall be suspended or revoked.\n\nSource. #5027, eff 12-19-90; ss by #6296, eff 7-23-96, EXPIRED: 7-23-04\n\nNew. #8181, eff 9-25-04 (from Saf-C 3003.11); ss by #10085, eff 1-31-12; ss by #13279, eff 10-19-21",
